    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money Trails</strong> is a casual clicker / idler game with city building elements and procedurally generated environments. Travel in your limousine on a path to choose new building ventures that increase your wealth and evolve your Island. Add money by clicking while earning passive income when idle. Random alerts and messages received on your Personal Digital Assistant can have positive or negative effects on your earnings and goals. You may need to make stops along the way to shop and replenish. Every trip is a new procedurally generated adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME A BILLIONAIRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your limousine is ready, Boss.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAVEL IN YOUR LIMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Roll the windows, turn on the radio and ride through procedurally generated, one of a kind biomes.\u00a0</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COUNT YOUR</strong>\u00a0<strong>MONEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Click and work to increase your wealth.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARN PASSIVE INCOME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sit back, relax or multi-task while your wealth automatically grows.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR COSTLY VICES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Negative effects may occur.\u00a0</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RECEIVE ALERTS ON YOUR PDA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Random incoming messages lead to positive or negative outcomes.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DECIDE WHAT TO BUY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stop your limo and shop for what you need to keep going.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE WHAT TO BUILD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose between different construction opportunities.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GROW YOUR ISLAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The more you travel and build, the more your bank account and island will endlessly evolve.</i></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money Trails</strong> is a casual clicker / idler game with city building elements and procedurally generated environments. Travel in your limousine on a path to choose new building ventures that increase your wealth and evolve your Island. Add money by clicking while earning passive income when idle. Random alerts and messages received on your Personal Digital Assistant can have positive or negative effects on your earnings and goals. You may need to make stops along the way to shop and replenish. Every trip is a new procedurally generated adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME A BILLIONAIRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your limousine is ready, Boss.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAVEL IN YOUR LIMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Roll the windows, turn on the radio and ride through procedurally generated, one of a kind biomes.\u00a0</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COUNT YOUR</strong>\u00a0<strong>MONEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Click and work to increase your wealth.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARN PASSIVE INCOME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sit back, relax or multi-task while your wealth automatically grows.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR COSTLY VICES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Negative effects may occur.\u00a0</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RECEIVE ALERTS ON YOUR PDA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Random incoming messages lead to positive or negative outcomes.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DECIDE WHAT TO BUY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stop your limo and shop for what you need to keep going.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE WHAT TO BUILD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose between different construction opportunities.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GROW YOUR ISLAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The more you travel and build, the more your bank account and island will endlessly evolve.</i></p></li></ul>",
